  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evidence and Research to Support Effective Use of Education Technology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project funds the main contract with Results for Development to deliver the Education Technology Hub. The contract supports the production of high-quality research, innovation pilots and technical assistance that help partner governments and organisations make effective decisions on the use of digital technology in education. Activities include generating evidence, supporting country partners to apply research to policy and practice, and strengthening national education systems in low- and middle-income countries. The project contributes to improved learning outcomes by ensuring decision-makers have access to reliable, relevant and timely evidence on technology-enabled education.</narrative>
  </description>
